[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":85},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":28,"_30":31,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":-5,"_41":-5,"_42":43,"_44":45,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":37,"_55":37,"_56":-5,"_57":37,"_58":59},"expiresAt",1795480833000,"id","cxpqkath9so8ongzhll7oibqa","title","Chrome 158 稳定版发布，修复 204 项安全问题","originalTitle","Stable Channel Update for Desktop","summary","Google 将 Chrome 158 推送至 Windows、Mac 和 Linux 稳定渠道，版本为 Linux 158.0.8127.36、Windows/Mac 158.0.8127.36/.37，更新将在未来数日或数周内逐步推出。","reason","公告集中列出 Chrome 158 的 204 项安全修复及对应 CVE、等级和报告者，便于按组件与风险级别梳理升级影响。","source",{"_64":84},"links",{"_77":83},"publishedAt","2026-11-17T19:12:07.339Z","discoveredAt","2026-11-17T21:24:35.892Z","timelineAt","category","vuln","tags",[81,67,82],"score",75,"selected",true,"channel","news","story","x","readingMode","full","author","Srinivas Sista","body",{"_59":76,"_77":-5,"_78":79,"_80":37},"outline",[70],"relatedStories",[],"topics",[60,61,62],"indexable","markdownAvailable","group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","zh",{"_63":68,"_64":69},{"_63":66,"_64":67},{"_63":31,"_64":65},"slug","name","漏洞披露","browser","浏览器","google","Google / 谷歌",{"_11":71,"_72":73,"_74":75},"sec-1","text","安全修复与奖励","level",2,"<p>&nbsp;<span>Chrome 团队很高兴宣布 Chrome 158 已推广至适用于 Windows、Mac 和 Linux 的稳定渠道。这将在未来几天/几周内逐步推出。</span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>Chrome </span><span><span>158.0.8127.36 (Linux)&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>158.0.8127.36/.37&nbsp;<span><span>Windows/Mac </span></span></span><span>包含多项修复和改进——变更列表可在</span><a href=\"https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/157.0.8103.80..158.0.8127.36?pretty=fuller&amp;n=10000\">日志</a><span>中查看。请关注即将发布的关于新功能以及 158 版本所交付重大成果的</span><a href=\"https://chrome.blogspot.com/\">Chrome</a>和<a href=\"https://blog.chromium.org/\">Chromium</a>博客文章</span></span></span></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\"><span>安全修复与奖励</span></h2><p><span>注意：在大多数用户安装修复版本之前，漏洞详情和相关链接可能会受到限制。如果该漏洞存在于其他项目同样依赖的第三方库中，但该库尚未修复，我们也会保留这些限制。</span></p><p><span>本次更新包含 </span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues?q=customfield1223088:0-M158\"><span>204</span></a><span> 项安全修复。更多信息请参阅 </span><a href=\"https://www.chromium.org/Home/chromium-security\"><span>Chrome 安全页面</span></a><span>。</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/562000561\"><span>562000561</span></a><span>] </span><span>严重</span><span> CVE-2026-130963：WebView 中释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-09-15 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/571153713\"><span>571153713</span></a><span>] </span><span>严重</span><span> CVE-2026-131031：GPU 中越界写入。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge (Anthropic) 在 Claude 协助下于 2026-10-07 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/573128234\"><span>573128234</span></a><span>] </span><span>严重</span><span> CVE-2026-131060：Media 中缓冲区溢出。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge (Anthropic) 在 Claude 协助下于 2026-10-13 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/574686297\"><span>574686297</span></a><span>] </span><span>严重</span><span> CVE-2026-131008：GarbageCollection 中释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge 于 2026-10-17 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/576812570\"><span>576812570</span></a><span>] </span><span>严重</span><span> CVE-2026-131054：ANGLE 中越界写入。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-22 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/577366760\"><span>577366760</span></a><span>] </span><span>严重</span><span> CVE-2026-130975：WebAudio 中释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge (Anthropic) 于 2026-10-26 报告</span></p><p><span>[$4,000][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/576579698\"><span>576579698</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130910：ANGLE 中保护机制失效。 </span><span>由 Arni Hardarson (Neonix Security) 于 2026-10-22 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/512778726\"><span>512778726</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130943：Chromecast 中释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-05-13 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/552672183\"><span>552672183</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130994：WebGL 中释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-08-26 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/560339053\"><span>560339053</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130909：Extensions 中释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-09-11 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/565839464\"><span>565839464</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131065：Autofill 中释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge (Anthropic) 在 Claude 协助下于 2026-09-24 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/566347710\"><span>566347710</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131100：Loader 中的释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge（Anthropic）报告，Claude 协助，于 2026-09-26</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/566377256\"><span>566377256</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130979：Forms 中的释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge（Anthropic）报告，Claude 协助，于 2026-09-26</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/568831763\"><span>568831763</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131079：Bindings 中的释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge 报告，于 2026-10-02</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/568891853\"><span>568891853</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130940：GPU 中的状态验证不当。 </span><span>由 Google 报告，于 2026-10-02</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/568896063\"><span>568896063</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130954：ANGLE 中的引用解析错误。 </span><span>由 Google 报告，于 2026-10-02</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/568896486\"><span>568896486</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130996：ANGLE 中的越界写入。 </span><span>由 Google 报告，于 2026-10-02</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/568937157\"><span>568937157</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130970：GPU 中的未初始化资源。 </span><span>由 Google 报告，于 2026-10-03</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/569191970\"><span>569191970</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131057：ANGLE 中的越界读取。 </span><span>由 Google 报告，于 2026-10-03</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/569197056\"><span>569197056</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130945：VR 中的释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Google 报告，于 2026-10-03</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/569659189\"><span>569659189</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131084：XML 中的释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge 报告，于 2026-10-05</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/570703733\"><span>570703733</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131090：Geometry 中的释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge 报告，于 2026-10-06</span></p><p><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/571284298\"><span>571284298</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130982：Omnibox 中的授权错误。 </span><span>由 Hafiizh 报告，于 2026-10-08</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/572237022\"><span>572237022</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131021：Accessibility 中的释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge（Anthropic）报告，Claude 协助，于 2026-10-11</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/572237023\"><span>572237023</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131022：DOM 中的释放后使用。 </span><span>由 Xinyang Ge（Anthropic）报告，Claude 协助，于 2026-10-11</span></p><p><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/572307225\"><span>572307225</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131081：Media 中的授权错误。 </span><span>由 Anthropic 和 Ada Logics. 报告，于 2026-10-10</span></p><p><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/572308124\"><span>572308124</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130961：Media 中的授权错误。 </span><span>由 Anthropic 和 Ada Logics. 报告，于 2026-10-10</span></p><p><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/572574561\"><span>572574561</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130984: Canvas 中存在授权不当问题。 </span><span>由 Hyeonjun Ahn (@_deayzl) 于 2026-10-12 报告</span></p><p><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/572682755\"><span>572682755</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130946: PerformanceAPIs 中存在授权不当问题。 </span><span>由 Arni Hardarson (Neonix Security) 于 2026-10-12 报告</span></p><p><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/572882344\"><span>572882344</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131045: PerformanceAPIs 中存在授权不当问题。 </span><span>由 Anthropic 和 Ada Logics. 于 2026-10-12 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/573263262\"><span>573263262</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131042: V8 中存在释放后重用问题。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-13 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/573263397\"><span>573263397</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131059: Autofill 中存在释放后重用问题。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-13 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/573266324\"><span>573266324</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130934: Autofill 中存在授权不当问题。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-13 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/573981230\"><span>573981230</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130951: Plugins 中存在释放后重用问题。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-15 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/574221485\"><span>574221485</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131013: Skia 中存在缓冲区溢出问题。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-16 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/574640593\"><span>574640593</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130941: HTML 中存在授权不当问题。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-16 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/574789298\"><span>574789298</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131068: DOM 中存在释放后重用问题。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-17 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/574795880\"><span>574795880</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130907: Autofill 中存在释放后重用问题。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-17 报告</span></p><p><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/574967987\"><span>574967987</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130914: ANGLE 中存在未初始化资源问题。 </span><span>由 definitelynotatable 于 2026-10-18 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/575201060\"><span>575201060</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-131082: CSS 中存在释放后重用问题。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-19 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/575201475\"><span>575201475</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危</span><span> CVE-2026-130915: CSS 中存在释放后重用问题。 </span><span>由 Google 于 2026-10-19 报告</span></p><p><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/575395237\"><span>575395237</span></a><span>] </span><span>高危